WEBVTT

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.650
When I open my photo book, I see different sides of me. {purichou...}

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:39.420
Laughing, {warattari}

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:42.200
or playing it cool, in all the pictures. {sumashitari de...}

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.930
I don't wanna say, "what's with all these characters?" But... {nani kore...}

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:47.640
Isn't this too much fun? {arisugi...}

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:50.220
For real? {maji...}

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.430
I mean, thanks! {tte yuu ka...}

00:00:53.010 --> 00:00:55.760
Even if I lose my way,  {maigo ni...}

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:58.370
my heart's egg {kokoro no...}

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.140
will be all right. Come back {daijoubu...}

00:01:01.140 --> 00:01:03.830
to me! {modotteoide}

00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:06.610
Hey, when we're together... {kimi to...}

00:01:06.610 --> 00:01:09.330
Hop, step, jump!

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:11.940
Because you're here... {kimi ga...}

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:14.590
Drew, draw, drawn!

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:17.460
I'm always with you...  {kimi to...}

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.180
Chip, syrup, whip!

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.860
One more time,  {mou ichido...}

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.470
unlock my heart! {kokoro...}

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.240
I love you.  {daisuki yo}

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:30.700
All of you.  {minna}

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.590
I want to be next to you. {soba ni...}

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.900
Okay? {ne...}

00:01:35.900 --> 00:01:37.050
Love ya! {suki yo}

00:01:45.520 --> 00:01:49.950
While the sun yet sleeps,

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:52.440
let us begin.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:57.910
As the world dances with the shadows following after the light.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:02:00.810
Yes, taking your hand.

00:02:00.840 --> 00:02:08.820
So what do you desire? What do you seek?

00:02:08.850 --> 00:02:13.530
The brilliance collected in the palm of that hand

00:02:13.560 --> 00:02:20.370
will scoop it up into the tainted night sky.

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:27.000
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:02:30.470 --> 00:02:32.050
What do you think, Director?

00:02:32.600 --> 00:02:36.800
This is the promotional video for Hoshina Utau's Pan-American debut.

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:42.340
The music that was recorded while she Character Changed with Dia holds a miraculous power.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:47.660
So you are going to take Utau and go to Los Angeles tomorrow?

00:02:47.690 --> 00:02:48.400
Yes.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:54.810
Using a special method at the L.A. studio, we'll absorb a large number of X Eggs into this master CD.

00:02:55.770 --> 00:03:02.070
If we do that, then we will no longer need to press X Eggs one by one, like the prototype teaser CDs.

00:03:02.870 --> 00:03:04.090
What are you implying?

00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:08.610
From now on, just by hearing Utau's song, whether through television, the internet,

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:12.830
or cell phones, a heart's egg can be extracted.

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:17.080
Utau's song will spread throughout the world like a virus,

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:21.620
and will be able to steal an infinite number of eggs.

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:25.450
Discovering the Embryo would only be a matter of time.

00:03:26.070 --> 00:03:31.080
Episode 42
Hoshina Utau! The Final Battle!

00:03:32.840 --> 00:03:37.890
Amazing, isn't it? Our victory is close at hand, Utau.

00:03:39.180 --> 00:03:40.320
Victory.

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:43.590
This is all thanks to Dia's incredible power.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:48.730
Your song's power is strengthened when you Character Change with Dia.

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:52.580
Oh, Il? You're still here?

00:03:52.730 --> 00:03:54.300
What mysterious creatures you are.

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:59.500
After I became aware that something was there, I was somehow able to see Guardian Characters.

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:01.300
Let me go, you old hag!

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:01.980
Old-

00:04:02.010 --> 00:04:04.440
I'll have you know that I'm still in my twenties!

00:04:05.220 --> 00:04:06.850
You aren't cute at all!

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:11.560
Since you're so useless now, isn't it about time we fired you?

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:12.740
Just like El.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.160
What?!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:20.340
Dammit! This is all your fault!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:23.290
Damn you! Damn you! Damn you!

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.570
What's your problem?

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.290
Your radiance is dim, isn't it?

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:29.500
She spoke!

00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:33.750
I can hear them.

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.580
The whispers of your heart.

00:04:37.450 --> 00:04:39.020
"She won't Character Transform with me."

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.460
"I'm frustrated and sad."

00:04:43.400 --> 00:04:48.230
But, "there is no need for a Guardian Character if you don't Character Transform."

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.950
Who said such a thing?

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:00.140
El.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.170
Amu-chan!

00:05:03.590 --> 00:05:06.330
If you go to sleep without drying your hair properly...

00:05:06.390 --> 00:05:08.330
You will catch a cold!

00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:10.550
I'm beat.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:12.790
Things got pretty crazy today.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.890
Fight, Amu-chan! You can do it!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:18.670
The final battle is tomorrow!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:21.750
We must stop Utau-chan, no matter what!

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:23.540
Mainly with my Character Transformation, right?

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:26.710
Amulet Clover should be the star!

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:28.640
Hey now...

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:32.690
You guys get to switch off, but I only have one body.

00:05:32.710 --> 00:05:34.960
This is no time for exhaustion!

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.230
We've got to save Utau-chan!

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.950
It was El's Character Transformation that made her so tired.

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:45.750
Yeah, it really takes a lot out of you to transform with someone else's Guardian Character.

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:50.350
I wonder if Utau gets tired when she Character Transforms with Dia.

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:56.580
Sis, why are you hiding it from me?

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:01.630
Take me with you! Take me to Utau-chan's concert!

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.880
I love Utau-chan!

00:06:04.990 --> 00:06:08.420
Don't stare at me, don't capture me!

00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:10.960
I'm a butterfly that's lost her way!

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:16.120
If tomorrow's the "final battle," what's with the carefree mood?

00:06:18.780 --> 00:06:20.810
Is that Kiseki?

00:06:22.540 --> 00:06:23.890
Tadase-kun?

00:06:30.790 --> 00:06:33.710
I'm sorry about stopping by so late unannounced.

00:06:34.370 --> 00:06:37.700
No, it's okay. Do you need something?

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:39.630
No, it's just...

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:47.890
Oh no! My hair's a total mess, and I should've at least changed out of my pajamas!

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:51.810
You see, there are two things I'd like to discuss with you.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:53.470
Two things?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.910
The first one concerns Hoshina Utau.

00:06:57.260 --> 00:07:02.060
Actually, although I haven't said anything about it before now,

00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:05.860
my family and the Tsukiyomi family used to be very close.

00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:09.680
I played with those two a lot when I was little.

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:12.000
Huh? You guys all played together?

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:13.670
Yeah.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.180
Me!

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:18.410
Me!

00:07:18.690 --> 00:07:22.790
Big Brother promised to play with me today!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:25.780
No way! His date with me comes first!

00:07:25.840 --> 00:07:28.220
Ikuto and me are going to finally go all the way!

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:31.640
Do you even know what that means?

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:54.610
As the bud of my dream opens up to the brilliant sky,

00:07:54.680 --> 00:08:02.870
it spreads a gentle fragrance through my heart.

00:08:03.090 --> 00:08:11.380
I can hear the rhythm of love.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:15.070
We had a lot of fun back then.

00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:17.960
But that's all in the past.

00:08:19.070 --> 00:08:25.390
Once Utau-chan started going to middle school, we didn't see each other anymore.

00:08:26.850 --> 00:08:31.560
We used to all come to this amusement park together.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:37.290
That girl used to be someone who loved to sing songs from her heart.

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:42.880
That's why, even if there's only a small chance, I think we can come to an understanding.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:48.680
I feel like you and Utau-chan hold the same radiance within you.

00:08:49.240 --> 00:08:50.530
The same radiance?

00:08:51.240 --> 00:08:55.460
Yes. Right now, Utau-chan is emitting a dark radiance.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:08:59.930
But you... I think you can change that to light.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.570
Me, change Utau?

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.090
Yes.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:09.130
Don't you think your expectations are too high?

00:09:09.170 --> 00:09:11.610
No, not at all.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.070
I believe in you.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:20.290
And, well, about the second thing...

00:09:22.890 --> 00:09:24.250
Hinamori-san.

00:09:24.570 --> 00:09:26.190
Is this...

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:28.210
Could it be...

00:09:28.340 --> 00:09:31.810
I'm going, too! To Utau-chan's concert!

00:09:31.850 --> 00:09:32.800
Hey, Ami!

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:37.840
You guys are gonna go to Utau-chan's concert tomorrow, right?

00:09:37.880 --> 00:09:38.860
We are not!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:41.450
Good evening, Ami-chan.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:43.430
My pwince.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:45.070
Don't say that!

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.560
Do not call <i>me</i> a "prince!"

00:09:48.770 --> 00:09:49.900
He's ascended?

00:09:49.530 --> 00:09:51.120
Wowee!

00:09:51.160 --> 00:09:55.290
I am no longer some dinky prince! I am the King! Understand?

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.710
Yesh! I understand, my yord King!

00:09:57.760 --> 00:09:59.830
Yes, that is an acceptable response.

00:10:05.370 --> 00:10:08.010
And the second thing he wanted to talk about?

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:09.640
I wonder what it was.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:10.970
Don't ask me!

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:28.600
It's finally time to spread your wings across the world, Utau.

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:33.850
We'll transfer to the airport in this helicopter, and then fly to L.A.

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:40.040
We'll then complete this master CD, and do a major Pan-American debut.

00:10:40.670 --> 00:10:45.130
The time for you to become the top singing sensation in the world has come, Utau!

00:10:45.670 --> 00:10:48.970
But it's only because of the power of the X Eggs.

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.640
It's not my actual talent.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.150
Good grief, not that again.

00:10:54.230 --> 00:10:56.780
It doesn't matter what methods you use, a win is a win.

00:10:56.830 --> 00:11:01.030
If you want to be on top, you need to be willing to win by beating down everyone else.

00:11:01.650 --> 00:11:06.220
You have that power, which is why I picked you.

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.680
Get it together!

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:12.070
We're about to take off. Get rid of those doubts of yours.

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:17.080
Why do I sing?

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:18.910
Is it for Ikuto?

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.820
No, I don't think that's it.

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:27.760
In the beginning, way back then, singing was just fun.

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:31.340
I'm going to be a singer, for sure!

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:34.960
My songs will make everyone excited and happy!

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.710
But now...

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:42.270
I can't see anything anymore.

00:11:43.270 --> 00:11:45.550
Not the moon, not the stars...

00:11:46.280 --> 00:11:47.900
Utau, we're leaving.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:49.080
Wait!

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:51.910
The evil shadow that lies in darkness...

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:54.500
I cannot overlook it!

00:11:54.550 --> 00:11:56.570
I kind of got used to it.

00:11:56.980 --> 00:11:57.840
Amu!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.070
It's El!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.500
Coming alone was...

00:12:01.540 --> 00:12:03.070
We are here as well!

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.080
Go, all of you!

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:10.890
My heart:

00:12:11.090 --> 00:12:12.500
My heart:

00:12:12.530 --> 00:12:13.510
My heart:

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.140
My heart, too:

00:12:15.240 --> 00:12:16.460
Unlock!

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:40.330
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:12:41.080 --> 00:12:43.590
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.570
Character Transformation: Samurai Soul!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:49.950
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:12:54.570 --> 00:12:57.410
Why are we doing this sort of thing?

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:59.420
We've been relegated to stage hands!

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.640
She didn't Character Transform with us again.

00:13:03.380 --> 00:13:06.810
Sister, I can no longer support what you are planning!

00:13:07.710 --> 00:13:09.980
So it would seem, Kairi.

00:13:10.570 --> 00:13:13.460
The debt I owe you will not change as long as I live,

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:17.450
and I am grateful for everything you have done for me over the years.

00:13:17.910 --> 00:13:20.920
But that's all the more reason for me to want you to understand;

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:22.950
understand why you are wrong!

00:13:24.470 --> 00:13:25.380
Chairman.

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.400
You're quite the troublemaker, aren't you?

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:31.750
Well, that's just like you.

00:13:34.270 --> 00:13:35.130
Amu.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:39.800
Utau, we came to talk.

00:13:41.350 --> 00:13:42.520
I don't have anything to-

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.060
You can still go back!

00:13:45.240 --> 00:13:47.480
You can go back to the time

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:48.980
when you really loved to sing!

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.080
The real Utau's-

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:53.340
Oh, what do <i>you</i> know?

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:56.410
How could someone who does everything halfway, like you,

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:59.410
possibly understand my suffering and sadness?

00:14:00.090 --> 00:14:04.460
Do you think you can change my life by <i>talking</i> to me?

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:06.500
Are you really that full of yourself?

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.330
Do you have that much confidence?

00:14:08.390 --> 00:14:10.010
Well, do you, Hinamori Amu?

00:14:12.390 --> 00:14:13.540
I...

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:18.120
Dia.

00:14:18.880 --> 00:14:22.140
I can hear the voice of your heart.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:29.900
You are a lost child. Even if you save X Eggs, or your friends, you still don't have confidence in yourself.

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.570
You are hesitant, and you waver.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.960
That is why your radiance is dim.

00:14:38.700 --> 00:14:40.570
You're right, I don't know.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.710
That's probably why I have so many Guardian Characters.

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.170
Amu-chan.

00:14:46.880 --> 00:14:49.590
So that's your answer?

00:14:49.970 --> 00:14:52.070
Then why did you come here?

00:14:53.770 --> 00:14:54.960
That's...

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.880
That's enough, Dia!

00:14:57.170 --> 00:14:59.880
Amu and I have no choice but to fight and finish this!

00:15:00.550 --> 00:15:03.160
I won't fight you!

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:05.360
Because I like you, Utau!

00:15:06.870 --> 00:15:09.720
What are you doing, Dia? Come back here!

00:15:12.460 --> 00:15:15.100
Fine, that's enough. Il!

00:15:16.130 --> 00:15:17.480
My heart:

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:18.390
Unlock!

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:33.510
Character Transformation: Lunatic Charm!

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:38.420
Please finish this quickly.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:43.300
Finally, the time for our final battle has come.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.800
Nightmare Lorelei!

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.670
Don't underestimate me, Guardians!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.190
Lilin Trident!

00:16:01.570 --> 00:16:02.600
Amu-chi!

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:04.010
El, guard!

00:16:04.050 --> 00:16:05.240
Leave it to me!

00:16:07.310 --> 00:16:09.480
White Flag Double Plan!

00:16:10.400 --> 00:16:11.570
El?

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:15.040
She stopped the attack!

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.570
It's unexpectedly effective.

00:16:16.610 --> 00:16:18.500
It's nonviolent resistance!

00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.650
We'll back you up!

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:22.380
Yeah!

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.330
Wait-nya!

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.350
The main character should always appear last-nya!

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:31.550
Ikuto!

00:16:32.100 --> 00:16:33.620
My heart:

00:16:33.670 --> 00:16:34.770
Unlock!

00:16:49.210 --> 00:16:51.890
Character Transformation: Black Lynx!

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:54.190
Here I go.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:16:58.880
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:07.050
Tsukiyomi Ikuto, why are you interfering?

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.130
This is a battle between Amu and Utau.

00:17:10.360 --> 00:17:12.460
I'll be your opponent.

00:17:13.610 --> 00:17:14.610
King!

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:18.650
I'll second you!

00:17:33.370 --> 00:17:34.820
Slash Claw!

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:37.960
In that case, it's my turn!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:42.540
New special attack: Go Go Little Duckies!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.830
Let's go, King!

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:47.710
Right.

00:17:48.740 --> 00:17:49.740
Guys!

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:50.810
Amu!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.300
This isn't the time to worry about your friends.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:54.880
Utau!

00:17:56.410 --> 00:17:57.230
Amu-chan!

00:17:58.610 --> 00:17:59.540
Il!

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:02.150
What?

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.950
What do you want, El?

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:06.220
Let's combine our powers!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.870
Together, we can save Utau-chan!

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:10.930
What're you talking about, retard?

00:18:10.990 --> 00:18:13.370
You should realize this, Il!

00:18:14.120 --> 00:18:17.460
Right now, Utau-chan isn't being her true self!

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:21.020
What are you doing, Il?

00:18:21.930 --> 00:18:22.750
Il!

00:18:23.010 --> 00:18:25.380
This is why Il's so...

00:18:29.610 --> 00:18:30.160
Il!

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:33.180
Il!

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:34.960
I'm so glad you understand!

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.400
I'm finally back to my old self!

00:18:43.380 --> 00:18:44.380
Il!

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:48.600
Hey, Amu! Let's do that thing!

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.690
What thing?

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:52.700
The "My heart: Unlock" thing!

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:03.500
Character Transformation: Amulet Devil!

00:19:03.540 --> 00:19:05.600
Hey, don't just do that!

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:11.090
Now both Il and El have left Utau.

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:14.340
Yes, you're right.

00:19:14.720 --> 00:19:17.790
That's fine, I don't need them.

00:19:18.200 --> 00:19:20.550
I still have Dia!

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:22.390
My heart:

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:23.600
Unlock!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.710
Character Transformation: Dark Jewel!

00:19:38.150 --> 00:19:39.730
Shining Black!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.330
Devil's Tune!

00:19:48.970 --> 00:19:51.290
Utau is being pushed back!

00:19:52.900 --> 00:19:56.270
Glitter Particle!

00:20:02.330 --> 00:20:03.200
Amu-chan!

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:04.640
Hinamori-san!

00:20:06.530 --> 00:20:07.670
She's strong.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:08.870
That's right.

00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:11.350
I <i>am</i> strong.

00:20:11.880 --> 00:20:14.200
Because I've thrown away those childish feelings of kindness.

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:18.660
I've always fought with my songs, and I've won!

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:22.900
I struggled so hard, it was like blood would pool in the shadow of the spotlights!

00:20:23.290 --> 00:20:29.280
There's no way I'd even consider losing to someone who uses kindness to excuse their weakness, like you!

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:33.270
Utau's radiance is unblemished.

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.360
Dia?

00:20:34.490 --> 00:20:38.430
Because a diamond cannot be scratched, it's beautiful and shines brilliantly.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:42.840
It's Utau's strong determination and resolve that allows her to sparkle.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:47.140
Can you sparkle as you are now?

00:20:48.260 --> 00:20:49.850
There's no way you can.

00:20:50.150 --> 00:20:53.070
That is your answer, Amu.

00:20:55.590 --> 00:20:59.900
It's frustrating. Anyone would be frustrated after losing.

00:21:00.740 --> 00:21:02.220
It's frustrating because you've lost.

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:07.920
But I don't think losing means you get hurt and then it's all over.

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:13.710
If you decide not to lose the next time, and give it your all, those wounds will make you stronger.

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:18.680
The people who lose many times should be able to sparkle brightest!

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:22.680
Maybe I do always hesitate and waver.

00:21:22.770 --> 00:21:24.940
Maybe I don't really know my true self.

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:28.370
I might just be a worthless kid who never follows through with anything!

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:34.700
But I still believe. I believe in the radiance inside of me!

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:47.620
I see. So that is your answer.

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:05.640
Dia!

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:17.640
Could it be... Is she going to Character Transform with Dia?

00:22:35.760 --> 00:22:42.730
There's no limit to the dreams we wild things can see.  {abarenbou...}

00:22:42.730 --> 00:22:43.870
(Yeah, yeah, yeah.)

00:22:43.870 --> 00:22:47.080
If we're born with 100% possibilities,  {kanouseo...}

00:22:47.080 --> 00:22:50.030
then let's keep livin' at 100%. {hyakupa...}

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:54.870
Let's cry and laugh, {naritari...}

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:58.490
and meet all kinds of people.  {ironna...}

00:22:58.490 --> 00:23:02.030
Let's discover what's precious, {daiji na}

00:23:02.030 --> 00:23:05.040
and even lose it. {nakushitari}

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:05.790
(But don't worry.) {hai donmai...}

00:23:05.790 --> 00:23:09.410
We've just gotta keep on runnin', {gan gan...}

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:12.200
because that way's the most fun, you see.  {sono hou...}

00:23:12.200 --> 00:23:13.120
(Right on, right on.)

00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:16.560
I wanna do this, and I wanna do that too. {are mo shitai...}

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:17.500
Let's go!  (Go!!)  {iku...}

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:18.540
Move out! (Yeah!!) {susu...}

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:20.780
Let's do it with gusto! {gachinko de ...}

00:23:20.780 --> 00:23:27.410
Because there's only one you in this world, {sekai ni...}

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:34.570
you've gotta make sure you find the things you love. {daisuki...}

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:51.360
Finally!

00:23:51.390 --> 00:23:52.030
Finally!

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:53.070
Finally!

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:54.880
Dia's come back!

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:57.250
You mean, for real? Can I believe it?

00:23:57.290 --> 00:23:59.380
Did my Dia come back?

00:23:59.410 --> 00:24:01.290
We've waited and waited!

00:24:01.320 --> 00:24:02.600
For this miraculous moment!

00:24:02.650 --> 00:24:04.770
It was a long wait, wasn't it?

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:08.970
Does this mean the final battle between me and Utau will end now?

00:24:09.010 --> 00:24:10.110
Seems like it.

00:24:10.450 --> 00:24:11.890
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.890 --> 00:24:13.730
Character Transformation! Amulet Diamond!

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:15.480
Amu-chan and Utau-chan!

00:24:15.510 --> 00:24:16.990
It's Character Transformations on parade!

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:19.440
Make sure to watch next time!
